  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiripchi Josia Jehovah paska eng’ Jerusalem; ak kieny aruetab paska eng’ betutab taman ak ang’wan ne bo arawet ne bo tai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiinde tiisik ripsosiekwak, ak kogiil ichek eng’ otisietab gotab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Lawik che kiineti Israel tugul, che ki tililen eng’ Jehovah, Onde moinget ne tilil got ne kiteech Solomon weritab Daudi laitoriatab Israel; ma koegu milet ne mi tigigoikwok: oot anyun Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, ak bikyik Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ochopge obee gorikab kwanisiekwok ko u ripsosiekwok, ko u sirutikab Daudi laitoriatab Israel, ak sirutikab Solomon, werinnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak otononse eng’ ole tilil ko u ole kigipcheita gorikab kwanisiek che bo tupchosiekwok lagokab bik, ak ingobunji age tugul kebebertab gotab kwanisiekab Lawik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak oeny aruetab paska ak oanyinyge, ochopchji tupchosiekwok, koyai ko u ng’olyotab Jehovah ne king’at eng’ Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiigochi Josia bik, che bo akwetab kechirek, arekab kechir ak che bo ng’ororek, kobunji choto tugul che bo kagochinoikab Paska, kogochi bik tugul che kimi yoto; kiek tugul elfusiek sosom, ak kirugik elfusiek somok: ki bo laitoriat chuto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiigochi bounikyik bik ak tisiik, ak Lawik, kagochinetab chamnyet. Kiigochi Hilkia ak Sekaria ak Jehiel, che bounikab gotab Kamuktaindet, kogochi tisiik, tuga elfusiek aeng’ ak bogol lo, ak eik bogol somok koek kagochinoikab paska. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiigochi Konania, ak Semaia ak Netanel, tupchosiekyik, ak Hasabia, Jeiel, ak Josabad, che eechen eng’ Lawik, kogochi Lawik, tuga elfusiek mut, ak eik bogol mut, koek kagochinoikab paska.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kochobok anyun otisiet ak kotononso tisiik eng’ komostanywa, ak Lawik eng’ ripsosiekwak, ko u ng’atutietab laitoriat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kieny aruetab paska, ak kiisisie tisiik korotik che kitaachei eng’ eunekab Lawik, ak kieny Lawik tiseiywechoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiisto kagochinoik che kibeelei, si kobiit kogoito, ko u ole kigipcheita gorikab kwanisiekab lagokab bik, kogochi Jehovah ko u ye sirat eng’ bukuitab Musa. Ak kiyachi ko u noto eik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibeel aruetab paska eng’ mat ko u kayomiset: ak kiiyo kagochinoik che tililen eng’ terenik, ak saburionik, ak tabokab karik, ak koipchi lagok tugul che bo bik kochaktae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye ibata kochopchigei ak tisiik; amu kichirjirendos tisiik werikab Aron kogoitoi kagochinoik che kibeelei ak mwanik agoi kemoi: kichopchigei anyun Lawik, ak tisiik, werikab Aron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimi komostanywa tienik werikab Asap, ko u ng’atutietab Daudi, ak Asap, Heman, ak Jedutun keerindetab laitoriat; ak kimi ribik ormarichet age tugul; kima ko nyoljin kobagakta boisienywa, amu kichopjin Lawik tupchosiekwak tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kichobok anyun otisiet tugul ne bo Jehovah eng’ betunoto, si korib paska, ak kogoito kagochinoik che kibeelei eng’ kaptisisietab Jehovah, ko u ng’atutietab laitoriat Josia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirib lagokab Israel che kimi yoto, paska, eng’ betusiechoto, ak korip igortab makatinik che ma kinde mermerek eng’ betusiek tisab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitom kobiit paska age koboch betusiekab maotiot Samuel ne kergei ak noto kigirib eng’ Israel; ama rib age tugul eng’ laitorinikab Israel ne u noto koyai Josia, ak tisiik, ak Lawik, ak Juda tugul ak Israel che kimi yoto, ak bik che kimenyei Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigirib paskainoto eng’ kenyitab taman ak sisiit ne bo laitornatetab Josia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingobata choto tugul ko kagochob Josia hekalut, kotogos Neko laitoriatab Misri kobargei ak Karkemis ye negite Euprate: ak kiwa Josia kobargei ak inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiiyokto Neko bik koba ole mi inendet, kolenji, Kiting’ege nee ak inye, laitoriatab Juda? Maabokyin inye, betuni, ago abokyini got ne ating’e boriet; ak kang’ata Kamuktaindet achokyi: bagakte, amegirinde Kamuktaindet ne mi kobota, si mabarin inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kima cham Josia kobagakta inendet, ago kiwalgei koek age si kobiit kobargei ak inendet, ama kas ng’alekab Neko che kibunu kutitab Kamuktaindet, ak kinyo kobargei eng’ atebwetab Megido.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwok mwogik laitoriat Josia; ak kilenji laitoriat otwogikyik, Omuta; amu kagiguotena mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komut anyun otwogikyik inendet eng’ karit, ak konde inendet karit ne bo aeng’ ne kitinyei, ak kiimut inendet konyo Jerusalem; ak kime ak kigitupchi kererisiekab kwanisiekyik. Ak kirirji Josia Juda tugul ak Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kirir Jeremia agobo Josia: ak kirirji Josia tienik tugul che murenik ak gotab kor, eng’ rirekwak agoi kora; ak kiyachi ichek kayomiset eng’ Israel: ak ogeero, sirotin eng’ bukuitab rirek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak boisionik che ng’etunotin che bo Josia, ak boisionikyik che miach, ko u che sirotin eng’ bukuitab Ng’atutikab Jehovah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak boisionikyik, che bo tai ak che bo let, ogeero, sirotin eng’ bukuitab laitorinikab Israel ak Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
